# A Class's level abilities (CR 716.2b): "{1}{R}: Level 2" and "{1}{R}: Level 3" are activated only as a sorcery and each
# only while the Class is the level before. On turn 3, with plenty of mana: Level 2 is refused in the beginning of combat
# step (sorcery speed); in main phase 2 Level 3 is refused at level 1, Level 2 is made (the positive control for both) and
# can't be made again, and reaching level 2 does not search the library (the tutoring is "becomes level 3": the library
# keeps its ten cards and the hand stays empty); Level 3 is then made, and only that one searches (Lightning Bolt) and, the
# hand holding only that card, discards it.

